Q10.
Predict the output, and identify the mistake in Point.

Code:
class Point {
    private final int x;

    Point(int x) {
        this.x = x;
    }

    int getX() {
        return x;
    }
}

class MutablePoint extends Point {
    private int x2;

    MutablePoint(int x) {
        super(x);
        x2 = x;
    }

    int getX() {
        return x2;
    }

    void setX(int v) {
        x2 = v;
    }
}

// inside main
Point p = new MutablePoint(1);

((MutablePoint) p).setX(50);

System.out.println(p.getX());

A. 1
B. 50
C. Compilation error
D. ClassCastException


